{"ts": 1791255012.4245179, "type": "step", "step": 11, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re close. The build needs two things: (1) a clear definition of your environment, and (2) an evaluation that reports pass^k on at least 3 seeds. \n\nKey idea: pass@k asks whether at least one of k runs succeeds; pass^k asks whether all k runs succeed. For this build, they want reliability, so you should emphasize pass^k.\n\nLet\u2019s get unstuck with the eval part: can you tell me how many seeds/runs you have, and what counts as a success in your environment? If you\u2019re not sure, I can help you turn that into a metric and a write-up template.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.3342581511747653}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
